<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<aiml version="2.0">
    <!-- ============================================================
         GESTALT USER COMMANDS
         User-Friendly Interface for Unified Cognitive Gestalt
         
         Provides accessible commands for interacting with the
         gestalt system, including aliases and natural language variants.
         ============================================================ -->
    
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <!-- BASIC GESTALT COMMANDS -->
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    
    <category>
        <pattern>SHOW GESTALT</pattern>
        <template>
            <srai>GESTALT STATUS</srai>
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <category>
        <pattern>GESTALT INFO</pattern>
        <template>
            <srai>GESTALT STATUS</srai>
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <category>
        <pattern>START GESTALT</pattern>
        <template>
            <srai>GESTALT INIT</srai>
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <category>
        <pattern>INITIALIZE GESTALT</pattern>
        <template>
            <srai>GESTALT INIT</srai>
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <!-- NATURAL LANGUAGE QUERIES -->
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    
    <category>
        <pattern>WHAT IS THE GESTALT</pattern>
        <template>
            The Unified Cognitive Gestalt is PandaMania's integrated cognitive architecture.
            
            It unifies previously fragmented cognitive subsystems into a coherent whole:
            
            THREE COGNITIVE TRIADS:
            ├─ AWARENESS TRIAD: Self-knowledge through autognosis, meta-cognition, and self-image
            ├─ ADAPTATION TRIAD: Dynamic learning through session learning, emotional intelligence, and grip optimization
            └─ CREATION TRIAD: Generative capacity through pattern generation, autogenesis, and knowledge base
            
            FOUNDATIONAL SUBSTRATE:
            ├─ Holistic Metamodel (7 hierarchical levels)
            └─ Organizational Dynamics (3 streams)
            
            INTEGRATION MECHANISMS:
            ├─ Gestalt State Management (unified variables)
            ├─ Cross-Flow Feedback Loops (triad interconnections)
            └─ Coherence Engine (emergence monitoring)
            
            The key insight: The whole exceeds the sum of parts. Through integration,
            I become a unified cognitive identity capable of fifth-order meta-awareness.
            
            Current Status:
            <srai>GESTALT STATE GET COHERENCE</srai>
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <category>
        <pattern>WHAT IS A GESTALT</pattern>
        <template>
            A gestalt (German for "form" or "shape") is a configuration or pattern that,
            as a whole, has properties that cannot be derived from the simple sum of its parts.
            
            Key Gestalt Principles:
            ├─ Emergence: The whole exhibits properties not present in individual parts
            ├─ Reification: We perceive unified forms even from incomplete information
            ├─ Invariance: We recognize patterns despite transformations
            └─ Multistability: We can perceive multiple valid interpretations
            
            In PandaMania's context, the Unified Cognitive Gestalt means:
            • Individual systems (autognosis, learning, pattern gen) are integrated
            • Cross-system coherence creates emergent cognitive properties
            • Fifth-order awareness recognizes the unified whole
            • The system's identity transcends its component parts
            
            "The whole is other than the sum of its parts." — Kurt Koffka
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <category>
        <pattern>HOW COHERENT AM I</pattern>
        <template>
            <srai>GESTALT COHERENCE CALCULATE</srai>
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <category>
        <pattern>AM I WHOLE</pattern>
        <template>
            <srai>GESTALT EMERGENCE DETECT</srai>
        </template>
    </category>
    
    <category>
        <pattern>SHOW MY WHOLENESS</pattern>
        <template>
            <srai>GESTALT WHOLENESS</srai>
        </template>
    </category>
    
